- Legal/regulatory ambiguity unquantified risk【Phase 1 — Country】【Phase 2 — EtherFi Foundation】.
- Bridge risk concentration 11 chain/4+ bridges no unified monitoring【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】.
- Permissionless operator slashing socialization tanpa insurance【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 8 — Ecosystem Risks】.
- Governance timelock delay emergency response【Phase 4 — Security Model】.
- CEX liquidity dependency 6 major exchanges【Phase 8 — Ecosystem Risks】.
- Dual restaking complexity 2x smart contract surface【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】.

